// parameter dividing as a numeric in a LANGUAGE sql function and procedure (1 + p / 100), integer arithmetic of casts overflowing
// (22003), enums ordered in the select list, in HAVING, GROUP BY, windows and by MIN, MAX, GREATEST and LEAST, and their labels checked
// (22P02), values of unmatched types in CASE, COALESCE, GREATEST, UNION, INTERSECT, EXCEPT and VALUES (42804) and an untyped text read as
// the other side's type (22P02), the SQL standard's interval fields (INTERVAL '1' DAY, '1-2' YEAR TO MONTH, columns and casts of
// them), DROP SEQUENCE under a column default (2BP01, CASCADE), two primary keys (42P16), a recursive CTE under LIMIT. Checked against
